---
description: Bhavcopy ingestion rules
globs: ["src/aurumspread/data/**", "tests/test_data*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Request date format DD/MM/YYYY; response Date is MM/DD/YYYY; ExpiryDate like 04SEP2026; strip Symbol whitespace.
- ALWAYS compare returned Date with requested date; if different, discard and log (holiday/future/invalid). Never store the substituted day under the requested date.
- Raw responses are saved unmodified in `data/raw/`; parsing produces `data/processed/*.parquet`. Ingestion is idempotent.
- Be polite to MCX: rate limit (max 1 request/second), retries with backoff, cache. 
- Unknown columns or format changes must raise a clear error, not be silently coerced. Validate against `docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md`.
- Do not assume Close == settlement price; see DATA_CONTRACT.md "Open questions".
